        "title": "Current Members — Elena Kagan",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-18",
        "excerpt": "Elena Kagan, Associate Justice, was born in New York, New York, on April 28, 1960. She received an A.B. from Princeton in 1981, an M. Phil. from Oxford in 1983, and a J.D. from Harvard Law School in 1986. She took her seat on August 7, 2010.",
        "tier": 1
      },
